OL,3,AWhy is Elon Musk plotting a mega-merger
OL,4,Aof SpaceX and Tesla?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith Tesla valued at roughly $1.5tn
OL,7,F(#1.1tn) and SpaceX at $2tn (#1.5tn), a
OL,8,Fcombination of the two companies would
OL,9,Fmark the largest merger ever.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
