OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1792570712
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AElon Musk confirms talks to merge Tesla
OL,4,Aand SpaceX
OL,5,
OL,6,FElon Musk has said he is actively
OL,7,Fconsidering merging Tesla and SpaceX,
OL,8,Fhis two biggest companies.
OL,10,F"Do I think it would be a good idea?
OL,11,FYes," Musk said during a call with
OL,12,Ffinancial analysts over the quarterly
OL,13,Fbusiness results of SpaceX on Tuesday.
OL,15,FWhile Musk noted the certainty of such
OL,16,Fa merger should not be assumed, and it
OL,17,Fwould need shareholders' support, he
OL,18,Fsaid special committees within both
OL,19,Fcompanies have been formed to examine
OL,20,Fthe move.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
