OL,3,AThe tech helping crack decades-old cold
OL,4,Acases
OL,5,
OL,6,FRandy Gail Sperino was last seen alive
OL,7,Fon the evening of 9 November 1993, as
OL,8,Fshe was getting into a pickup truck in
OL,9,FGranite City, Illinois.
OL,11,FThe 34-year-old's body was found hours
OL,12,Flater in a field nearby, the victim of
OL,13,Fblunt force trauma.
OL,15,FThe identity of her killer was a
OL,16,Fmystery. DNA evidence found at the
OL,17,Fcrime scene was tested against standard
OL,18,Flaw enforcement databases, but no
OL,19,Fmatches were found.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
